            <p>Congenital Rubella. This image demonstrates the blueberry muffin-like skin lesions indicative of congenital rubella. Public Health Image Library, <ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://phil.cdc.gov/Details.aspx?pid=713">Public Domain</ext-link>, Centers for Disease Control and Prevention</p>
